      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Data Architecture: Stateless",
      "items": [
        "NO database, NO Firebase, NO Firestore — fully stateless architecture",
        "All data fetched live from ESPN, Sleeper, and weather APIs on each request",
        "Gemini structured outputs conform to 6 Pydantic schemas (JSON mode enforced)",
        "SendGrid delivers responsive HTML digests to damiththa@gmail.com"
      ]
